            "text": "theorem canonical_past_identity {k : ℝ → ℝ} (hk : IntegrableOn k (Ioi 0))\n    {X : ℝ} (hX : 0 ≤ X) :\n    -(∫ x in Ioi 0, k x) + (∫ x in Ioc 0 X, k x) = -(∫ x in Ioi X, k x)"
